  "issue": {
    "headline": "TIF districts, and who is inside them",
    "body": "Tulsa is Oklahoma's second metro and runs an extensive tax-increment finance programme alongside county jail and detention contracting. A TIF district diverts future property tax off the general roll for decades; the increment schedule and the participation agreements are public, and they say precisely who benefits and for how long.",
    "record": "TIF project plans and participation agreements, plus the annual increment reports filed with the County Assessor."
  },
